[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441942598","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4323#issuecomment-441942598","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4323","id":441942598,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTk0MjU5OA==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-08-21T23:50:28Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:24:00Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nthe problem is pg_catalog.format_type() is applying quotes which doesn't match:\n\n\n```\n  SELECT a.attname,\n              pg_catalog.format_type(a.atttypid, a.atttypmod),\n              (SELECT pg_catalog.pg_get_expr(d.adbin, d.adrelid)\n                FROM pg_catalog.pg_attrdef d\n               WHERE d.adrelid = a.attrelid AND d.adnum = a.attnum\n               AND a.atthasdef)\n              AS DEFAULT,\n              a.attnotnull, a.attnum, a.attrelid as table_oid,\n              pgd.description as comment\n            FROM pg_catalog.pg_attribute a\n            LEFT JOIN pg_catalog.pg_description pgd ON (\n                pgd.objoid = a.attrelid AND pgd.objsubid = a.attnum)\n            WHERE a.attrelid = %(table_oid)s\n            AND a.attnum > 0 AND NOT a.attisdropped\n            ORDER BY a.attnum\n        \nINFO:sqlalchemy.engine.base.Engine:{'table_oid': 1785621}\nDEBUG:sqlalchemy.engine.base.Engine:Col ('attname', 'format_type', 'default', 'attnotnull', 'attnum', 'table_oid', 'comment')\nDEBUG:sqlalchemy.engine.base.Engine:Row ('q', '\"UpperCase\"', None, False, 1, 1785621, None)\n\n```\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441942598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441942600","html_ur